Output docs/vhs/out/04-switch-env.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
F4 Sleep 500ms Type "stag" Enter Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+W Type "V" Sleep 1500ms Escape
Ctrl+P Type ":env local" Enter Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
